WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.839
This is the status report of the Çekicin AI roadmap,

2
00:00:03.889 --> 00:00:06.707
checked on the twenty-sixth of October 2026.

3
00:00:06.757 --> 00:00:09.444
The Çekicin team asked for six AI modules:

4
00:00:09.494 --> 00:00:14.723
damage detection from a photo, a repair or replace decision with a cost estimate,

5
00:00:14.773 --> 00:00:18.764
spare-part suppliers and prices, voice guidance for customers,

6
00:00:18.814 --> 00:00:23.327
the nearest service points, and waiting time and environmental impact.

7
00:00:23.377 --> 00:00:27.107
On average, the roadmap is about fifty-eight percent done.

8
00:00:27.157 --> 00:00:30.822
Every module has a working demo on the website, a command

9
00:00:30.872 --> 00:00:34.341
in the Telegram bot, and its own Hugging Face project.

10
00:00:34.391 --> 00:00:37.600
None of them is inside the Çekicin mobile app yet.

11
00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:42.428
Module one, damage detection, is about seventy percent done.

12
00:00:42.478 --> 00:00:47.327
On an independent test of one thousand photos, it finds the damage on eighty-four

13
00:00:47.377 --> 00:00:51.983
percent of damaged cars, with fifteen percent false alarms on undamaged ones.

14
00:00:52.033 --> 00:00:56.035
In today's live test, a close-up bumper photo was correctly flagged

15
00:00:56.085 --> 00:01:00.268
with a crack and a scratch, but a light scratch on a truck was missed.

16
00:01:00.318 --> 00:01:04.803
Module two, the repair decision and cost, is about fifty-five percent done.

17
00:01:04.853 --> 00:01:09.338
The price range covers fifty-eight percent of eleven hundred real listings.

18
00:01:09.388 --> 00:01:13.390
It still needs calibration with real invoices and assessor reports.

19
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:18.428
Module three, spare parts and prices, is about sixty percent done.

20
00:01:18.478 --> 00:01:22.150
The price database has three thousand seven hundred and eighteen

21
00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:26.046
listings for one hundred and forty-nine car types, and two thousand

22
00:01:26.096 --> 00:01:29.594
seven hundred and fifty-six of them have a photo of the part.

23
00:01:29.644 --> 00:01:32.734
In a check of five hundred rows, the price matched the

24
00:01:32.784 --> 00:01:35.642
source listing in ninety-nine point eight percent.

25
00:01:35.692 --> 00:01:39.073
Live stock and price agreements with suppliers are missing.

26
00:01:39.123 --> 00:01:42.678
Module four, voice guidance, is about fifty-five percent done.

27
00:01:42.728 --> 00:01:46.342
Voice messages are transcribed with ninety-five to ninety-seven

28
00:01:46.392 --> 00:01:49.482
percent word accuracy, but the answers are still text.

29
00:01:49.532 --> 00:01:52.390
Spoken Turkish answers and a phone line come next.

30
00:01:53.640 --> 00:01:56.148
Module five, the nearest service points,

31
00:01:56.198 --> 00:01:59.090
is the most complete, at about eighty percent.

32
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:02.863
In all twenty of Türkiye's big cities, a workshop was found

33
00:02:02.913 --> 00:02:06.956
within fifteen kilometres, and a parts shop in eighteen of them.

34
00:02:07.006 --> 00:02:10.474
Today's live check in Istanbul returned five workshops.

35
00:02:10.524 --> 00:02:15.590
Module six, waiting time and environmental impact, is about thirty percent done.

36
00:02:15.640 --> 00:02:19.107
It is an open simulator, not yet proven with real data.

37
00:02:19.157 --> 00:02:23.008
The tow truck or roadside help decision passes all twenty-one

38
00:02:23.058 --> 00:02:26.270
scenario tests, and the Telegram assistant is live.

39
00:02:27.520 --> 00:02:29.563
You can test everything yourself.

40
00:02:29.613 --> 00:02:34.827
The PDF report has clickable links to the test website on Cloudflare, to a separate

41
00:02:34.877 --> 00:02:39.647
section for each module, and to the Telegram bot with one button per module.

42
00:02:39.697 --> 00:02:42.755
To move from demo to product, the next steps are:

43
00:02:42.805 --> 00:02:44.848
integration into the Çekicin app;

44
00:02:44.898 --> 00:02:49.605
training and calibration with Çekicin's own photos, invoices and call logs;

45
00:02:49.655 --> 00:02:50.556
spoken answers;

46
00:02:50.606 --> 00:02:53.410
and a pilot that measures real waiting times.

